abstract: "A dependency-free Python library for token-economics cost accounting of LLM agents: it decomposes per-task spend into prompt, completion, tool-call, and retrieval tokens priced per model tier, and provides tiered routing with per-task budgets so agent costs can be forecast and budgeted before deployment."
